      <sparkle:criticalUpdate />
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>What's new in 1.2.1</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed the macOS certificate showing "Installed & Trusted" when it wasn't actually installed yet.</li>
          <li>Revoke now prompts for your keychain password and removes the certificate so you can reinstall it cleanly.</li>
          <li>Installing the cert into an iOS Simulator now restarts it so running apps trust it, with clear Installed / Connected states.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
